",text:"「好好活，是一门技术」\n\n尹烨老师在脱不花的节目里讲的就很干货。\n\n他的核心观点：\n\n1️⃣强调人体是一个动态平衡的生态系统而非机器，长寿的关键在于生活方式的重塑。\n\n2️⃣详细列举了饮食顺序、运动标准、深度睡眠以及情绪调节等五个维度的核心原则，比如。\n\n吃：先吃什么后吃什么（比如先菜再肉再主食这种顺序）\n\n动：运动要达到什么标准（不是瞎走两步）\n\n睡：重点盯“深度睡眠”怎么提高\n\n情绪：怎么把压力、焦虑从身体里放出去\n\n3️⃣通过提供具体到全天候的时间表和行动清单，把生活方式调过来。靠自律的日常，把身体状态和心理状态一起养稳、养长。\n\n修身\n\n撸毛这些年，钱钱没赚到，胖了几十斤。开年先撸一个好身体，未来的日子遇佛杀佛。\n撸猫人的意志力非常强，非常耐操。答应我，狗命要紧。\n听10遍。\n\n视频+音频---得到app-\nhttps://t.co/nCNXljbaZE"}}}}}}}}}))($R["tsr"]);document.currentScript.remove()</script><div hidden id="S:0"><div class="relative h-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[600px]" id="urt:conversation:2008520381905195278:none:default"><ul><li><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 px-horizontal py-vertical border-b border-gray-100" data-timeline-entry="" tabindex="-1"><article class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch"><div class="relative z-10"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none active" href="/KuiGas" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@KuiGas" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="40px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/195151